  - cherry-pick, onto the registry pins, the new commits that build without git Taffy, git Stylo or Dioxus 0.8 — the founder's last two shapes. Which of the seventeen build so is P3's reading, commit by commit [premise-corrected: thirteen build, gates green at 218 · 1294 · 0 · 12 with the pins, the lock and `deny.toml` unmoved, and `22f0cd000` (`AGENTS.md`) is leaned out, so twelve; `ac6f9f582` needs git Stylo, its `BackgroundClip::Text` `gecko`-only on Stylo 0.22, with `e5929f9e2`, `0674e8efa` and `784a567e4`; upstream's `6ef4b532d` test cannot read on Dioxus 0.7 and stays out, its guard standing];
  - that take plus winit beta.4 (`a09f46792`, `527394724`): a registry pin moved inside upstream's own coupled set, so no git dependency, but "pins unchanged" no longer holds — passed over by him at the last sync, measured green there [VERIFIED: on top of the thirteen, 219 · 1297 · 0 · 12, audit and doc 0];
